            </note>
            <note corresp="#d929-f3" n="22" xml:id="d929-f3-content">
                <p>Lancelot Oliphant, Head of the Eastern Department, British Foreign Office.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d929-f4" n="23" xml:id="d929-f4-content">
